et_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S05","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":5,"global_order":5,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S06","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":6,"global_order":6,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Let's just start anywhere.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S07","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":7,"global_order":7,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So, eventually, that's all about AI - that's not the sort of near horizon - there's a lot of valuable stuff that can be done before you get there, but it's about preparing for AI.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":8,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So if you, at the moment, take any existing approach to language, acquisition, and try to, to build a way for AI to be implemented as part of that approach, it's going to have very limited value.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":9,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There will, I'm sure be some things that you could do - different AIs for different sets of activity or knowledge and so on - so it's not that it's an impossible thing and that it can't be added...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":10,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So on that - so to help unpack that a little bit...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S11","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":11,"global_order":11,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"so let's talk in terms of examples, for example, the traditional learner model acquisition might be a bit more like...what?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S12","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":12,"global_order":12,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I mean, give some examples...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S13","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":13,"global_order":13,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There's so many different ones!","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S14","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":14,"global_order":14,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You've got this thing - the big issue in second language acquisition as an academic field now is that you've got consensus that there are maybe six or seven, major theories of second language acquisition.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S15","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":15,"global_order":15,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"None of them is entirely wrong and none of them is entirely right.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S16","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":16,"global_order":16,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you've got this academic consensus that there's value to all of them and that there isn't one right way to do it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S17","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":17,"global_order":17,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And that's fascinating because it's the kind of academic consensus that gains a really strong hold on a field of inquiry.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S18","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":18,"global_order":18,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S19","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":19,"global_order":19,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and I think it's fundamentally incorrect.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S20","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":20,"global_order":20,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I think the idea that, we've tried to figure this thing out and we couldn't, we've just figured there are lots of elements.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S21","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":21,"global_order":21,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah, and it's tricky for me because I've got some really good friends, who are absolutely fantastic SLA people and, very significant figures in the field and they're making brilliant contributions and they're doing brilliant work.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S22","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":22,"global_order":22,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I just feel through - it's not the fault of any individual, but that there is this global academic consensus that they all work a bit.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S23","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":23,"global_order":23,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then the inquiry that follows on from that is trying to drill down to very small pieces of information and see if that particular thing can, or can't be proven to be useful or non-useful.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S24","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":24,"global_order":24,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"instead of saying, let's take a step back.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S25","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":25,"global_order":25,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Are we actually trying to yeah, exactly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S26","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":26,"global_order":26,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S27","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":27,"global_order":27,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and then there's another issue, I think in terms of academic work on SLA, which is that there isn't as yet as much overlap with the work that's been done on neuro-plasticity.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S28","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":28,"global_order":28,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you've got it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S29","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":29,"global_order":29,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's not yet a normal thing for an SLA researcher.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S30","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":30,"global_order":30,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"To be well versed in what's happening with neuroplasticity.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S31","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":31,"global_order":31,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And I think that's a problem because a lot of the things, I often said is that, SLA people are looking at a black box.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S32","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":32,"global_order":32,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And they're trying to figure out how you get to certain output by varying the inputs.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S33","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":33,"global_order":33,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and they're doing it with a lot of testing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_n