Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":41,"global_order":41,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"at the same time as we're strengthening our, Listening, understanding.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S42","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":42,"global_order":42,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"so are we getting double value in one neural circuit?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S43","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":43,"global_order":43,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and I have to say, no, we're not because of a fundamental tenet of our understanding of the brain is that knowledge flows in one direction in a neural circuit.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S44","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":44,"global_order":44,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"that's just how it works.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S45","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":45,"global_order":45,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You don't get reverse circuits.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S46","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":46,"global_order":46,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So what we've got when we're producing speech is one neural circuit - when we are.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S47","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":47,"global_order":47,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"decoding some what somebody else is saying to us that is a different neural circuit - they just cannot be the same circuitry.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S48","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":48,"global_order":48,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you've got interesting stuff in there, of course: do we, the, all this stuff is up for grabs.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S49","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":49,"global_order":49,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Do we have, when we know that, that the word for fish in Welsh is pysgod, do we have.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S50","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":50,"global_order":50,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"A one central neurological, tightly dense neurological circuitry that gives us connection of those two words.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S51","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":51,"global_order":51,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"or do we have a separate, a piece of neurological circuitry where the idea that pysgod is this kind of animal is established.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S52","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":52,"global_order":52,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then we just have a link between the idea that fishes is this animal is established.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S53","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":53,"global_order":53,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And we just get a neural, a little piece of information flowing in both those two directions.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S54","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":54,"global_order":54,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Or do we have that kind of setup for speech and then a separate kind of setup doing the same work for understanding?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC01-S55","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"On Demand/Streaming Tech","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":55,"global_order":55,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We don't know - there aren't answers to this, and.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"ta