if you have a certain limit to the resources you've got, where should you as an individual best spend your time in these 17 characteristics?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S06","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":6,"global_order":70,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"it's almost a hundred percent certain not to be equally across all 17...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S07","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":7,"global_order":71,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":72,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Even if you were the average individual learner, or not a teacher at all.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":73,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":74,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"It would almost certainly not be equal.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S100","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":100,"global_order":164,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So which words plug into which other words, if I've just said the word red, what are, what is the range of words that I can now say after that word?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S101","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":101,"global_order":165,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I can say red bus, I can say red, and then you get pattern recognition in there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S102","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":102,"global_order":166,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I've got, okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S103","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":103,"global_order":167,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Red, anything, that's like a bus or red thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S104","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":104,"global_order":168,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Anything that's like a thing I can't say red going.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S105","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":105,"global_order":169,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yes.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S106","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":106,"global_order":170,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I can't say, I can't say, Red went, and this turns out to be really quite useful.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S107","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":107,"global_order":171,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"you can say some things that you wouldn't immediately.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S108","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":108,"global_order":172,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So if we said to somebody, give us a list of all things after read that list, us a lot of nouns.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S109","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":109,"global_order":173,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and that would probably be pretty much it, but you can't, for example, say red but yeah, because red but take that as a discrete item.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S11","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":11,"global_order":75,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So to what extent, these things really make an impact and how valuable they are and these different approaches, even though they have pros and cons of each of them, we can't measure.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S110","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":110,"global_order":174,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That sounds well, no, that doesn't mean anything.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S111","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":111,"global_order":175,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But, yeah, but of course been in the middle of conversation, you're saying, I'd like one that's red, but I don't mind all that much.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S112","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":112,"global_order":176,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah, exactly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S113","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":113,"global_order":177,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So we've got a little bit of information there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S114","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":114,"global_order":178,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There is a kind of construct in which sometimes after, We can't use the word, but, so what we're doing is, and this is by, this is a stroke of luck, really for us, but the vast majority of traditional language teaching is high on vocabulary items.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S115","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":115,"global_order":179,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yes.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S116","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":116,"global_order":180,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And high on grammatical rules, but very low on exposure to edges.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S117","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":117,"global_order":181,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you tend to learn a new word and then you learn a couple of contexts in which you can use that word, but then you're meant to extrapolate from the grammatical rule to any other time you want to use it in another context, but you're not given exposure to those other contexts in the classroom, or often in the practice of what you're doing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S118","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":118,"global_order":182,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you're left and you see this - it's almost a visual thing - people at a certain stage in their language development with a new language, you'll hear that they have a huge amount of 'um-ing' and 'ah-ing' going on.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S119","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":119,"global_order":183,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and that will be inter-word.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S12","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":12,"global_order":76,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Accordingly to do the SLA research.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S120","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":120,"global_order":184,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So they, will be talking in this kind of way, with these sort of little big gaps now, when you give people a lot of exposure to the edges.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S121","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":121,"global_order":185,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S122","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":122,"global_order":186,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You still hear 'um-ing' and 'ah-ing', but it's at a kind of higher order.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S123","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":123,"global_order":187,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you'll get a block of words.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S124","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":124,"global_order":188,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and then a bit of a pause and then this other thing, because they've got the flexibility going on, to be starting then to see right here are my blocks and then they just start to chunk them up.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S125","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":125,"global_order":189,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and you simply don't hear the same kind of pause after each word.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S126","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":126,"global_order":190,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So this is, what we're suggesting is that you have - the brain has - these item encoded items for words, but then it is also probably just as simple as a neural chain between the, these blocks that this word has got a neural connection.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S127","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":127,"global_order":191,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's a physical thing - there are neurons and synapses leading from this word to that word, but there are no neurons and synapses leading from this word to that word that you can never use after it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S128","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":128,"global_order":192,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S129","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":129,"global_order":193,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and what you get - when people try to describe that as an emotional thing - they say it just felt right.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S13","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":13,"global_order":77,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"We can't measure really how much they're better than other or equal or whatever.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S130","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":130,"global_order":194,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And what that means really is that there weren't any neural paths taking me to any other word there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S131","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":131,"global_order":195,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I had to go to this one, right?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S132","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":132,"global_order":196,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Is it perhaps similar to words that tend to go together that we know of from quotes quite often.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S133","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":133,"global_order":197,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And for example, 'to boldly go' is something, if I said to boldly, go because it, because of that edge, that we've created, you have it as a kind of a unit, which is more commonly heard.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S134","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":134,"global_order":198,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Some words really go together, even though there's no reason for them to go together because of usage,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S135","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":135,"global_order":199,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"What you're getting into now and this is the other sort of thing that is not really a central part of most language acquisition methodology.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S136","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":136,"global_order":200,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"you're getting into some of the absolutely rock solid, brilliant work that's been done in terms of memory.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S137","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":137,"global_order":201,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S138","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":138,"global_order":202,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Now memory is a major interest of yours.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S139","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":139,"global_order":203,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's also something that's a lot closer to the black box of neuroplasticity.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S14","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":14,"global_order":78,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So aside from all of that...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S140","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":140,"global_order":204,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"A lot of the stuff that's happening with memory is what is happening at the synaptic level?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S141","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":141,"global_order":205,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"What are the, what are the neuro-transmitters?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S142","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":142,"global_order":206,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"What are the chemical charges?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S143","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":143,"global_order":207,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"What exactly can we measure happening here?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S144","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":144,"global_order":208,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Can we measure.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S145","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":145,"global_order":209,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"dampening effects as well as increasing effects?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S146","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":146,"global_order":210,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So we're really - the work done on memory in the last 40-50 years is fantastically detailed.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S147","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":147,"global_order":211,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and it's a pity for me, I think in some ways that, in terms of","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S148","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":148,"global_order":212,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Hasn't been applied to language acquisition much..","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S149","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":149,"global_order":213,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That - but also the memory, if you see you read about it in the newspapers and stuff like that, it tends to be all about memory tricks and yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S15","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":15,"global_order":79,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"what are, give me one or two examples of a typical way you might learn a language and why that doesn't set itself up for AI in a way or ML machine learning, that perhaps our methodology does?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S150","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":150,"global_order":214,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Which is nothing wrong with that, but it's like, It's all quite divorced from the utility of, this is memory is being able to have a good memory and a good working and a good short term memory and a good luck on all those things is extremely valuable in every everyday learning, in conversation and learning.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S151","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":151,"global_order":215,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"All these things.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S152","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":152,"global_order":216,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It all sounds a little bit like smoke and mirrors, you go and read about in the press and, 'Oh, there's this guy who's learnt 'pi' to a hundred digits and there's probably some smoke and mirrors stuff going on there, and there's very little sort of public conversation about how incredibly detailed our understanding of certain memory processes are and the ones that we just don't understand yet.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S153","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":153,"global_order":217,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S154","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":154,"global_order":218,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So when you start to talk then about, okay, how do we form these connections between words?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S155","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":155,"global_order":219,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"it, the very simple, memory research there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S156","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":156,"global_order":220,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"is Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S157","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":157,"global_order":221,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We respond to exposure, okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S158","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":158,"global_order":222,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There's the sort of one set of memories which don't need any kind of repetition.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S159","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":159,"global_order":223,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So your hugely emotional stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S16","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":16,"global_order":80,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S160","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":160,"global_order":224,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"you don't remember the most embarrassing thing that's ever happened to you because you've sat and revised it, it's because you haven't had enough therapy to get rid of the trauma and it's just going to be there forever!","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S161","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":161,"global_order":225,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But yeah for the bulk of stuff for anything to do with sort of information and acquiring information it's exposure.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S162","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":162,"global_order":226,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"it's massively by combination of, frequency and recency.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S163","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":163,"global_order":227,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S164","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":164,"global_order":228,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So when you get when you say, to boldly...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S165","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":165,"global_order":229,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and you asked me to guess what the next word is going to be, and I'm going to say go.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S166","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":166,"global_order":230,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"but I'm not going to say that because I watched an episode of Star Trek.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S167","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":167,"global_order":231,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm going to say GO because you hear that all the time.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S168","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":168,"global_order":232,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S169","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":169,"global_order":233,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"it's quoted and there are multiple episodes or maybe watch more than one of them.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S17","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":17,"global_order":81,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S170","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":170,"global_order":234,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S171","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":171,"global_order":235,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And it's used as an example of when splitting an infinitive is actually, really quite a valuable thing to do for emphasis...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S172","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":172,"global_order":236,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Massive, massive, massive frequency.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S173","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":173,"global_order":237,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S174","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":174,"global_order":238,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S175","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":175,"global_order":239,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S176","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":176,"global_order":240,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And this really is, and this is how, it, one of the ways in which every single conversation impacts on your use of language.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S177","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":177,"global_order":241,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm not conscious of why I've used that structure a couple of times here, and it could be, there are all sorts of different things it could be I've been saying it recently.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S178","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":178,"global_order":242,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You might've said it earlier in the conversation or, but yeah,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S179","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":179,"global_order":243,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"so there's conversational etiquette - a reflection, which is the complex adaptive system is that - when you're talking to certain people who use shorter words, you will tend to shorten your words.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S18","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":18,"global_order":82,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So the, the core issue across this sort of consensus, or the core problem as far as I'm concerned is that they all perceive that you have to do two things to acquire language: You have to gain vocabulary knowledge, and then you have to develop some kind of a grammatical schema that allows you to put the vocabulary knowledge into the right order to communicate.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S180","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":180,"global_order":244,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Or if you're then in an academic context, you will tend to use more elaborate sentences","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S181","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":181,"global_order":245,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and also just the sort of simple mathematics.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S182","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":182,"global_order":246,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you just said academic context.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S183","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":183,"global_order":247,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S184","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":184,"global_order":248,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That's not something I've never heard before.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S185","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":185,"global_order":249,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I've heard it before.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S186","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":186,"global_order":250,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I've now heard it more often than I previously had heard it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S187","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":187,"global_order":251,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S188","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":188,"global_order":252,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So the next time I hear the word academic, my brain is going to be prepping for an infinitesimal, tiny bit more than it would have done.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S189","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":189,"global_order":253,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S19","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":19,"global_order":83,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and that is.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S190","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":190,"global_order":254,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"All you hear context you'll hit on its own and think, Oh, context is related to academic context.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S191","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":191,"global_order":255,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And I think this, I'm fascinated by this as well - the ability for humans to make connections between things and to then split up things...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S192","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":192,"global_order":256,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"and one of the thing, I was just.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S193","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":193,"global_order":257,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"came to mind just as you were talking is how words themselves can contain a lot of meanings that once we take them apart, we say, Oh, that's interesting.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S194","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":194,"global_order":258,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"For example, listless, we often talk about things being listless.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S195","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":195,"global_order":259,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"We don't often talk about list itself.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S196","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":196,"global_order":260,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S197","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":197,"global_order":261,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So there's kind of directions that words themselves take you down.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S198","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":198,"global_order":262,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And which, if you go back a little bit and say, what are the components that even make up this thing that we cause like, why is listless a word?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S199","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":199,"global_order":263,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Why is it not two words?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S20","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":20,"global_order":84,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Pretty much, That's standard across all of them -even though they might have different ways of going about doing those two things - fundamentally it's units of actual knowledge vocabulary and then ways to put the words together to make grammatical sense.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S200","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":200,"global_order":264,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"because it's actually two, what we would call syllables., We would, most people identify sound waves that could be broken up more or less into two components which start and stop.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S201","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":201,"global_order":265,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Therefore, we read them all, listen to them as syllables, but it's quite interesting.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S202","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":202,"global_order":266,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Isn't it?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S203","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":203,"global_order":267,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"That list is obviously word on its own.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S204","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":204,"global_order":268,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Less is a word, listless we use...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S205","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":205,"global_order":269,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"and this whole idea of when does a word have meaning and when does it have its own context?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S21","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":21,"global_order":85,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So they, the problem with that, and there's a sort of standard thing, a more common thing in neuroplasticity that, you really need if.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S22","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":22,"global_order":86,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If you can see something complicated happening, and you think you have a solution for it, you really need to think about how is that going to work at the neuron level - just obviously we're just dipping our toes in the waters there - but there are some things that we know reasonably well.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S23","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":23,"global_order":87,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So the question for me, is an, and this is it's something you can go and do in lots of different fields of knowledge and anything that is based on people and on what people do and how they do it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S24","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":24,"global_order":88,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"it's almost always gonna be an interesting question to say, right?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S25","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":25,"global_order":89,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"What's happening, neurologically there - how is that running?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S26","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":26,"global_order":90,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We've got this sort of central engine, this device, which drives a huge percentage of who we are and what we do.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S27","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":27,"global_order":91,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And we're starting to figure out bits about it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S28","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":28,"global_order":92,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So when you ask the question, when you say, so how do we acquire vocabulary - neurologically speaking, that's not particularly complicated.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S29","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":29,"global_order":93,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's not all that simple but.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S30","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":30,"global_order":94,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"we've got a broad understanding that, neurons, and the synapses, encode information, we've got some interesting stuff that we're figuring out about the difference between how long a kind of information would last.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S31","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":31,"global_order":95,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"what is effectively short term memory?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S32","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":32,"global_order":96,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"What's longterm memory.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S33","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":33,"global_order":97,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Are they in different places?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S34","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":34,"global_order":98,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We know the hippocampus is involved.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S35","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":35,"global_order":99,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"the transition between the two.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S36","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":36,"global_order":100,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S37","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":37,"global_order":101,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"we don't have a 'this is how it works' model there yet.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S38","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":38,"global_order":102,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"but you say presume that on average, the connection of a word.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S39","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":39,"global_order":103,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"To, an image or a concept, involves a few thousand neurons linked in a sort of linked in a group dealing with things like, syllables and sound shapes and all that stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S40","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":40,"global_order":104,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"there's a lot of different discrete information that we tend to think, a word is just the thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S41","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":41,"global_order":105,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Of course, it's not, it's much more complicated than that, but yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S42","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":42,"global_order":106,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You end up with, you could even imagine it as a neuron, but it's a neural collection of things which store this information.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S43","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":43,"global_order":107,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S44","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":44,"global_order":108,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"so that exists there and then we access it in different ways.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S45","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":45,"global_order":109,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So that's fundamentally straightforward in terms of how we understand the brain at the moment.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S46","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":46,"global_order":110,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sen