ystems.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S86","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":86,"global_order":150,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I think.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S87","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":87,"global_order":151,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I think those folks are going in the right direction because I think fundamentally language is a complex adaptive system.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S88","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":88,"global_order":152,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And a lot of the ways in which it works, I just emergent properties, fairly simple initial conditions.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S89","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":89,"global_order":153,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"but the, and that's where I think WE sit that the people who are working in that area at the moment, seem to be focusing mainly on the way in which language interaction works as a complex adaptive system.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S90","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":90,"global_order":154,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"so your patterns of language use change slightly every time you have a conversation with somebody.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S91","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":91,"global_order":155,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"you and your usage at the moment, carries within it, the shadows of every previous conversation you've had,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S92","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":92,"global_order":156,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"not focusing so much on the learning itself and the acquisition","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S93","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":93,"global_order":157,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"exactly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S94","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":94,"global_order":158,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Now over a period of time, that's, in a complex way to provide you with the means of communication, and then the way in which this input from you is altering the way in which I speak all that kind of stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S95","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":95,"global_order":159,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And which is all interesting.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S96","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":96,"global_order":160,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And I think, I think they're doing something important there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S97","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":97,"global_order":161,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"What we're doing then is looking at how, what if language is a complex adaptive system, how can that impact on the way in which people acquire the language?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S98","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":98,"global_order":162,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and what we're building around, is this core perception that you don't have words under grammatical schema, you have, individual information about words.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC02-S99","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Traditional Methods & AI","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":99,"global_order":163,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and about the edges between words.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.675247+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S01","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":1,"global_order":270,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There's a researcher, a very highly regarded researcher called Alison Wray whose main field, what she's mostly known for his work on formulaic language.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S02","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":2,"global_order":271,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and, one of the things she's been thinking in the last few years and starting to say, and to suggest, at least she's done that in conversations.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S03","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":3,"global_order":272,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I don't know if she's published on this yet.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S04","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":4,"global_order":273,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"is.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S05","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":5,"global_order":274,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There's no such thing as a word.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S06","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":6,"global_order":275,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S07","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":7,"global_order":276,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There aren't any.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":277,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We use it to mean something which doesn't really exist and it's just actually not a very helpful way of breaking things down.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":278,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And it does.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":279,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's a lovely, - every time she said every time I've heard her say that, I thought.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S11","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":11,"global_order":280,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S12","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":12,"global_order":281,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I don't think I can keep up with my brain is already hurting, but she could say that interesting claims,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S13","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":13,"global_order":282,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"she probably will say there's something as a syllable or there's a sound.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S14","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":14,"global_order":283,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yes.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S15","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":15,"global_order":284,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S16","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":16,"global_order":285,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yes.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S17","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":17,"global_order":286,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S18","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":18,"global_order":287,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And then there's ways that these units of sound that start and stop, are put together, which we might,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S19","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":19,"global_order":288,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"so she would say, for example, one of the things, in that sort of line of thinking, that without thinking it through, we would definitely claim that to boldly go is three words but actually in lots of different ways in which you could try to define what a word is 'to boldly go' is one word, and then you're into woo...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S20","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":20,"global_order":289,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"because it's as a unit of contained meaning isn't it...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S21","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":21,"global_order":290,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"there's another thing in terms of these, neural pathways, if we're just building, neural clusters for semantic information for - let's call them words, even if they don't exist - we're building neural clusters of those.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S22","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":22,"global_order":291,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And with building the edges, we're building the neural links between those clusters.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S23","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":23,"global_order":292,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S24","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":24,"global_order":293,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S25","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":25,"global_order":294,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So if that's all we're doing, then that is enough to create emergent behavior.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S26","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":26,"global_order":295,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But now here's another fascinating thing about it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S27","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":27,"global_order":296,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If you give somebody a set of, and this is a very traditional learning, give them a set of neural clusters.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S28","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":28,"global_order":297,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's a pity that the recordings can't pick up my pathetic attempts to act this out.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S29","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":29,"global_order":298,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Isn't it?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S30","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":30,"global_order":299,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I think they'll get it - he's banging on the side of the chair.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S31","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_labe