_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S51","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":51,"global_order":320,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm taking control of this process.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S52","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":52,"global_order":321,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm enjoying it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S53","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":53,"global_order":322,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm playing a game.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC03-S54","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"There's No Such Thing as Words","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":54,"global_order":323,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm doing some clever stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S01","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":1,"global_order":324,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So on that note - how I introduce your method to people is I say, okay, I'm going to take you to a context - this is a drama class.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S02","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":2,"global_order":325,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"You're just playing a warmup game.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S03","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":3,"global_order":326,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And the game is called Holy Dickhead Batman.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S04","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":4,"global_order":327,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"If I explain this to you...holy Dickhead Batman.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S05","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":5,"global_order":328,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And the idea is everyone just calls up as many different random combinations of that they can make up.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S06","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":6,"global_order":329,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Holy BatHead, ManDick, Holy, DickMan, Bathead, Holy HeadDick ManBat, and all that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S07","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":7,"global_order":330,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And it's just fun because people do it and it's playful and it's illustrating the ability to make words or kind of units of meaning work for you.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":331,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"If you learn them as these minimum viable units of meaning, and then play around with them","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":332,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and giving people permission to play around with it, because actually even if the order doesn't then lead to a real act of communication it's still okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":333,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So just play with it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S11","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":11,"global_order":334,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then when you play and you get something that triggers an act of communication, then you get the feedback, but Oh, that worked.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S12","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":12,"global_order":335,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S13","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":13,"global_order":336,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"You get everything clicking together.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S14","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":14,"global_order":337,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Like the Revenge of the Sith.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S15","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":15,"global_order":338,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S16","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":16,"global_order":339,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"that kind of, in a sense.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S17","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":17,"global_order":340,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That's the curative element for traditional approaches.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S18","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":18,"global_order":341,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So what happens is traditionally people go through, whatever way they're being led to do it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S19","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":19,"global_order":342,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"They're acquiring vocabulary.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S20","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":20,"global_order":343,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and they're acquiring some kind of grammatical schema, which is meant to give them a rule set.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S21","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":21,"global_order":344,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So the vocabulary units can be put together, have some kind of, convey some sort of meaning,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S22","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":22,"global_order":345,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and then you get them to the point where 'here's a person who speaks that language, you have to try and communicate with them' And then what they have to go through, and this is.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S23","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":23,"global_order":346,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"when you ask, the vast majority of language educators, when you say, OK, I'm a strong intermediate now, how do I get to fluent?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S24","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":24,"global_order":347,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And they will tell you practice, go and use it, go and listen to lots of radio and television and talk to a lot of people.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S25","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":25,"global_order":348,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And that's true.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S26","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":26,"global_order":349,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That's right.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S27","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":27,"global_order":350,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That's what you have to do, but it's incredibly painful if you haven't prepared for it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S28","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":28,"global_order":351,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If all you've got is, vocab items and rule set, what you then do you go into that environment?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S29","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":29,"global_order":352,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"where you have to start creating your own instances to test whether or not they work.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S30","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":30,"global_order":353,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Now, if you're encouraged there to be playful than that will make that process much less painful.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S31","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":31,"global_order":354,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But if before you get to that stage, you've already been trained to go through a lot of different paths.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S32","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":32,"global_order":355,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Then this is not a step-change anymore.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S33","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":33,"global_order":356,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's just more of the same - you're carrying on doing it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S34","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":34,"global_order":357,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So then you're just into when your exposure levels, hit here, you're going to feel okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S35","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":35,"global_order":358,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And it's.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S36","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":36,"global_order":359,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S37","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":37,"global_order":360,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So, the thing you were saying quite awhile ago now.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S38","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":38,"global_order":361,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S39","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":39,"global_order":362,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Circling back to your stuff and where it's different and machine learning and all that stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S40","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":40,"global_order":363,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So somebody, if we take.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S41","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":41,"global_order":364,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And, there are lots of different ways it's can happen.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S42","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":42,"global_order":365,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We take somebody who goes into an evening class, so that they're going once or twice a week to their two hour, evening class to learn a language.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S43","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":43,"global_order":366,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And in that evening class, there will be a combination of, new vocabulary items being presented.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S44","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":44,"global_order":367,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S45","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":45,"global_order":368,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There may, if you're lucky, there may be some sort of gameplay stuff and there may be some little bits of role-play there'll be going around the class person.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S46","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":46,"global_order":369,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S47","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":47,"global_order":370,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And there'll be, understanding conjugations and stuff like that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S48","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":48,"global_order":371,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So broadly speaking, there'll be words, there'll be grammatical schema.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S49","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":49,"global_order":372,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then maybe then with the best teachers, there'll be some kind of a, not so formal environment for you to try and use some of these things.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S50","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":50,"global_order":373,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah..","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S51","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":51,"global_order":374,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"The standard pattern here is: that is an incredibly slow way to acquire a language.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S52","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":52,"global_order":375,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It takes a very long time - if you're going to an evening class, twice a week, it's going to be five to 10 years before you're having really good conversations and that's going to be happening to everybody else.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S53","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":53,"global_order":376,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you're going to think that's normal and it's okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S54","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":54,"global_order":377,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And it's just, that's what it's like.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S55","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":55,"global_order":378,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's a slog.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S56","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":56,"global_order":379,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"That's how you learn a language as an adult.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S57","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":57,"global_order":380,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Exactly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S58","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":58,"global_order":381,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Exactly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S59","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":59,"global_order":382,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"One of the things that's happening there, is because your, because of the focus on the grammatical schema, there's much less repetition of of the new vocabulary items.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S60","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":60,"global_order":383,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And of course you've got that, less rich environment of the edges between the words.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S61","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":61,"global_order":384,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you're short on edges, but you're also short on repetition of the vocabulary items.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S62","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":62,"global_order":385,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So when you come back next week, you've forgotten most of them and then often - instead of going back and doing the revision next week, you'll be onto a bunch of new stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S63","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":63,"global_order":386,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S64","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":64,"global_order":387,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and in many cases, apart from whether a really good teachers operating, who understand that they have to help with the process of building the memories, you can get people who've got, a syllabus, they working to - who'll do all this stuff in week one.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S65","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":65,"global_order":388,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"They'll ignore the fact it's been forgotten by week two, do all the new stuff in Week 2 - ignore the fact that's been forgotten, do all the new stuff in Week 3 and then what's happened is that, is those earlier memories only rarely become functional when an opportunity arises, largely at random, for them to be reinforced later on.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S66","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":66,"global_order":389,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So it's not - the vast majority of syllabuses - simply don't have a significant focus on spaced repetition.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S67","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":67,"global_order":390,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"They don't think, Oh, at this point we have to go back and look at all that stuff again.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S68","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":68,"global_order":391,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's just, you were meant to have learnt that - that was your homework.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S69","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":69,"global_order":392,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Surely, obviously - make sure you've learnt it for your homework.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S70","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":70,"global_order":393,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But you're saying that to people who aren't memory specialists, how are they meant to learn it?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S71","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":71,"global_order":394,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"One of the things you see very often, which absolutely breaks my heart and you'll see this in schools all over the place.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S72","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":72,"global_order":395,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You'll see kids who really care and are really making an effort and you'll see their workbooks and you'll see them full of fucking highlighting!!!","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S73","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":73,"global_order":396,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And we, the results are in...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S74","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":74,"global_order":397,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"it makes zero difference highlighting going through a text Worse than zero - it takes time","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S75","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":75,"global_order":398,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"and doesn't produce any value.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S76","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":76,"global_order":399,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S77","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":77,"global_order":400,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and you just seeing that they've been told, go and learn it, because they're not memory specialists, they don't know how to learn it, but they have, at some stage been told, highlight it or they've seen somebody else doing it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.783243+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S78","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":78,"global_order":401,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It may just have been, an older brother or sister.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S79","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":79,"global_order":402,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So they go and highlight it and they're busting their guts.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S80","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":80,"global_order":403,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"They're trying to make it work.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S81","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":81,"global_order":404,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And they're doing something which is proven not to make a difference and we're letting them down.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S82","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":82,"global_order":405,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Just shatteringly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S83","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":83,"global_order":406,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"This is our responsibility as the generation who's gone through it to be able to say, Oh, by the way, this is how you form a memory.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S84","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":84,"global_order":407,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If you do these things, you will then remember it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S85","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":85,"global_order":408,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And we're not doing that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S86","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":86,"global_order":409,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And the vast majority of teachers of course, are not memory specialists.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S87","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":87,"global_order":410,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So they're not conscious of that stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC04-S88","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Holy Dickhead Batman","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":88,"global_order":411,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And they're doing what they've seen other people do - just gigantic systemic failure.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S01","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":1,"global_order":412,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"There's a whole bunch of things I want to unpack in there at some point, maybe later on in this one, but let's just stay on spaced repetition then, because you brought that up.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S02","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":2,"global_order":413,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And I think most people listening to this know what spaced repetition is, but how, how is it?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S03","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":3,"global_order":414,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"let's talk about this, a little spaced repetition in the methodology...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S04","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":4,"global_order":415,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"how did YOU stumble across it?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S05","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":5,"global_order":416,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And why was it really important for you?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S06","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":6,"global_order":417,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And when did you realize how important it was, to what extent is it important and how often do you work out how to repeat things and all that sort of stuff?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S07","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":7,"global_order":418,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"There's a lot in there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":419,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":420,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"isn't there just, yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":421,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S100","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":100,"global_order":511,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"It's not anecdotal when it's a large number of people.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S101","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":101,"global_order":512,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"It's like anecdotal is an interesting one because people are very dismissive of stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S102","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":102,"global_order":513,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S103","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":103,"global_order":514,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"But actually crocodile.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S104","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":104,"global_order":515,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S105","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":105,"global_order":516,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I lost my foot in that river please accept my anecdotal evidence!","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S106","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":106,"global_order":517,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I started playing around there with what happens when you give yourself enough time to forget it and how much time do you need to forget it?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S107","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":107,"global_order":518,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And it became obvious incredibly quickly that what we would normally expect - okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S108","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":108,"global_order":519,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If I haven't worked all that hard and it's a week from now, it'll be gone.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S109","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":109,"global_order":520,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Absolutely wrong.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S11","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":11,"global_order":422,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"the there's nothing new or magical about spaced repetition.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S110","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":110,"global_order":521,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Absolutely wrong!","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S111","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":111,"global_order":522,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"A week from now, still a little bit too easy to access.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S112","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":112,"global_order":523,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"so I started extending it and extending it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S113","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":113,"global_order":524,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S114","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":114,"global_order":525,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I've tested up to 16 months now.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S115","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":115,"global_order":526,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"zero apparent recall, and then after 16 months you test yourself and you find that there is remarkable resilience of the memory.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S116","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":116,"global_order":527,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So what tends to happen is - if you're working in the way in which we operate.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S117","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":117,"global_order":528,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you get a prompt in English and you're then being challenged to produce that in the target language.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S118","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":118,"global_order":529,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S119","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":119,"global_order":530,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S12","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":12,"global_order":423,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's incredibly well understood.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S120","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":120,"global_order":531,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"When you have a, when you have a prompt for something that you learned 16 months ago and have not revisited, you - absolutely guaranteed - you will not remember that saying.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S121","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":121,"global_order":532,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"From that prompt?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S122","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":122,"global_order":533,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"No.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S123","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":123,"global_order":534,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"so if I say, if I taught you how to say, I want to watch football at the weekend in Manx...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S124","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":124,"global_order":535,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"so I teach you how to say that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S125","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":125,"global_order":536,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and I get you to the point where you're saying it on one day and then we leave it and we drop it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S126","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":126,"global_order":537,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And 16 months later, I come back, I say to you, can you tell me the Manx for, I want to watch football at the weekend?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S127","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":127,"global_order":538,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You will say, no, I can't.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S128","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":128,"global_order":539,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"No, that was 16 months ago up yours mate.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S129","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":129,"global_order":540,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2