t":"and this is now backed up by further research in the field.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S21","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":21,"global_order":432,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"He said, you want to revisit the word just before you forget it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S22","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":22,"global_order":433,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S23","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":23,"global_order":434,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Now, when are you going to forget it?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S24","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":24,"global_order":435,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"that's hard to unpick, but what we can do is a kind of half-life projection on it","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S25","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":25,"global_order":436,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Based on average learners.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S26","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":26,"global_order":437,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S27","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":27,"global_order":438,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You can give people a bunch of work to learn some vocabulary.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S28","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":28,"global_order":439,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"you can test them on that vocabulary a month later and see how many, they still remember months after that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S29","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":29,"global_order":440,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and so on.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S30","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":30,"global_order":441,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You have to be a little bit careful.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S31","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":31,"global_order":442,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You really need groups that get tested a month later.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S32","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":32,"global_order":443,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Groups that get tested two months later, otherwise you're giving them spaced repetition.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S33","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":33,"global_order":444,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"but you can do that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S34","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":34,"global_order":445,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then you can build a perception that says, okay, this person, or in general, this is a current after your first amount of work, it will be lost at about this stage.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S35","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":35,"global_order":446,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So let's revisit it just before that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S36","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":36,"global_order":447,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S37","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":37,"global_order":448,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Right now that is, there's a flaw with this","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S38","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":38,"global_order":449,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Ebbinghaus was the guy, who originally came up with this stuff, wasn't it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S39","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":39,"global_order":450,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So the very early work, the German guy, and he just points to one set of random stuff that he memorized himself.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S40","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":40,"global_order":451,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And it's samples and have one, as people often say it's really sample size himself doing it and corroborated by nobody else.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S41","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":41,"global_order":452,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"They just requote his sort of initial information on these optimal times.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S42","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":42,"global_order":453,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"However, the technique has definitely been shown to have significant validity over.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S43","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":43,"global_order":454,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S44