":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S48","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":48,"global_order":459,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"exactly where I'm about to go.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S49","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":49,"global_order":460,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S50","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":50,"global_order":461,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and I didn't remember his name, but I think I have a faint memory of that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S51","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":51,"global_order":462,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S52","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":52,"global_order":463,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"The original guy who came up with that Pimsleur to my awareness was the first guy really to look at that in language acquisition context.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S53","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":53,"global_order":464,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and, but so now here's the interesting thing - there's another idea which is not directly connected, but they end up moving up instead of meshed.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S54","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":54,"global_order":465,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and this is much more recent, piece of thought from a guy called Dr. Robert Bjork, who.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S55","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":55,"global_order":466,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Certainly used to work in the university of California may still and this is the idea of desirable difficulty.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S56","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":56,"global_order":467,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S57","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":57,"global_order":468,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and really what he's doing that it's similar stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S58","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":58,"global_order":469,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So he's identifying that, when you're having those initial repetitions, the problem with them is precisely that they're too easy.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S59","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":59,"global_order":470,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I can say a new word.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S60","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":60,"global_order":471,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I told you the Welsh for fish was pysgod.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S61","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":61,"global_order":472,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and then if I asked you just to keep saying pysgod, You're not really creating an extra memory there because it becomes too easy.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S62","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":62,"global_order":473,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"pysgod, pysgod.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC05-S63","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":63,"global_order":474,"speaker