":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Spaced Repetition","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":99,"global_order":510,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S01","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":1,"global_order":557,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There's a possibility that you've got.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S02","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":2,"global_order":558,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So, two sliding scales that it's interesting to play around with in terms of the individuals, emotional response to the process of learning.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S03","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":3,"global_order":559,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you could be saying to somebody, we're going to help you learn in the shortest amount of time, Or you could be saying to them, we're going to help you learn with the smallest amount of active effort.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S04","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":4,"global_order":560,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S05","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":5,"global_order":561,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So in that case, if we want it to be in the smallest amount of time, we're going to be teaching you on day one, We're going to be repeating it on day two day, three day, four day five in with a whole bunch of other stuff, you're going to have done it five times by the end of that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S06","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":6,"global_order":562,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"you're gonna have had five days where you do it multiple times by the end of that, you'll probably be okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S07","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":7,"global_order":563,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"alternatively, so instead of that might be, you might end up over the course of five days with say 25 repetitions of that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":564,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and then maybe you're good at that stage.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":565,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Alternatively, we can teach it to you.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":566,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"maybe repeat it three or four times here until you're managing to get it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06