iency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":104,"global_order":660,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah, because speed means you can start using it now.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S105","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":105,"global_order":661,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"All boy.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S106","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":106,"global_order":662,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And then with utility then you get all the tremendous benefits of them using it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S107","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":107,"global_order":663,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Cause what we're trying to do in your system more than anything is get people up to operational conversations with people.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S108","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":108,"global_order":664,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So then they can, then their language can develop","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S109","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":109,"global_order":665,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There's some evidence - somebody in Cardiff university was telling me once, that they see a very wide range of routes and time implications to get to 4,000 words, but post 4,000 words, it all looks pretty much the same.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S11","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":11,"global_order":567,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"As soon as you say it correctly, we go, We're finished.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.888207+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-1:SC06-S110","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-1","scene_number":6,"scene_label":"Chapter 6","scene_title":"Time versus Efficiency","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":110,"global_order":666,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Gotcha.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:21.964003+00","updated_at":